PASS | fort-sill | FAQ JSON-LD == visible | got=[('Why does DTMO call it Fort Sill/Lawton?', 'DTMO sets BAH by Military Housing Area, and Fort Sill and the city of Lawton share one area, FORT SILL/LAWTON, OK (OK237). Lawton ZIPs such as 73505 use the same rates.'), ('Does 2027 BAH at Fort Sill cover rent and utilities?', 'It depends on rank. With typical 3-bedroom rent of $950–$1,300 and utilities of about $240–$470 a month, a Sergeant (E-5) with dependents ($1,233) lands between −$537 and $43 a month after housing. These are planning estimates, not official figures.'), ('Do I get a different rate if I live in a nearby town?', 'No. BAH follows your permanent duty-station ZIP, not your home address.'), ('When do these rates apply?', 'These are the calendar-year 2027 rates. Rate protection keeps your rate from dropping while you stay at the same post with the same status; a PCS, a reduction in grade or a change in dependency status resets it. DTMO usually publishes the next year’s rates in mid-December.')] | exp=[('Why does DTMO call it Fort Sill/Lawton?', 'DTMO sets BAH by Military Housing Area, and Fort Sill and the city of Lawton share one area, FORT SILL/LAWTON, OK (OK237). Lawton ZIPs such as 73505 use the same rates.'), ('Does 2027 BAH at Fort Sill cover rent and utilities?', 'It depends on rank. With typical 3-bedroom rent of $950–$1,300 and utilities of about $240–$470 a month, a Sergeant (E-5) with dependents ($1,233) lands between −$537 and $43 a month after housing. These are planning estimates, not official figures.'), ('Do I get a different rate if I live in a nearby town?', 'No. BAH follows your permanent duty-station ZIP, not your home address.'), ('When do these rates apply?', 'These are the calendar-year 2027 rates. Rate protection keeps your rate from dropping while you stay at the same post with the same status; a PCS, a reduction in grade or a change in dependency status resets it. DTMO usually publishes the next year’s rates in mid-December.')]
